{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "f0a1caa9-328f-5444-8f42-40171789eab5", "source_ordinal": 2325, "reading_ordinal": 1730, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "让爱", "published_at": "2023-03-31T02:25:13+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/19689377/answer/2961481302"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你的确有可能做到让别人深深的迷恋你、深深的依赖你、深深的向往你、深深的渴望你、深深的崇拜你、深深的相信你、深深的感激你……但你做不到“让”人深深的爱你。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一旦你动了手脚，故意去利用人的人格弱点制造这些迷恋、依赖、向往、渴望、崇拜、相信、感激，你所获得的种种亲切、好意的动机就被干扰了，性质就被混杂了。", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你会忍不住想，如果ta不是要依赖我，还会不会这样对我？如果我不能再保持ta的迷恋，这一切还会不会一样？", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 202}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你很清楚，对方的亲近、关怀中有你自己干预的结果。这些手段和资源，向谁倾泻，谁都会在欲望驱使之下不由得亲近、关怀。", "char_start": 203, "char_end": 259}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你确有这样的能力而且用了，你心里就会清楚，不是ta选了你，而是你选了ta。", "char_start": 260, "char_end": 299}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "对方只是没有能力在你的引诱、威逼之下保持自由意志，所以给了你你想要的结果，是被骗的、被诱惑的、被操纵的，这和自己做一个机械臂来拥抱自己有何区别？", "char_start": 300, "char_end": 372}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "孤独依然是孤独，只是白白折损了一个人的人格。哪来的爱？倒不如说只有罪。", "char_start": 373, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "为什么做人要宽容和体谅？因为我要拿掉你因害怕我不原谅而做的勉强，我要消解你不敢随自己的意离开的顾虑，我要取消一切你不得不爱我的理由。这样我才能知道，你不离开，就是因为你不想离开。你爱我，就是因为你想爱我。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 512}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "因为我没有做任何威逼利诱、没有任何愚弄和操纵，于是人对我的任何一点爱，都变成了真正的、纯的、无可怀疑的爱。", "char_start": 514, "char_end": 567}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "人对人的爱，可贵的永远都不是尺度、体量，不是按金额、按时长、按被记住的年月来算的，而是按纯度来算的。", "char_start": 569, "char_end": 619}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "无可怀疑的爱，已经是深爱了。", "char_start": 620, "char_end": 634}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "所以，给人完整的自由，不催、不逼、不闹、不怨，不在任何意义上人为扭曲和操纵对方的意志，给对方完全的选择自由，就是让人深爱你的最好努力。", "char_start": 635, "char_end": 702}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "至于对方是不是会深爱你，随遇而安。", "char_start": 703, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "其实如果你真的明白，而且这样去做，你是不用担心的——你不知道这样的你有多特别，多可爱。", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 764}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "发现有人会错误的理解“威逼利诱”，觉得这意味着不能对对方流露好感，也不能对对方展现优秀。", "char_start": 765, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这种想法是没有必要的。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 821}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这都不构成“威逼利诱”。", "char_start": 822, "char_end": 834}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "所谓威逼，是指“你不爱我，我就如何如何”。", "char_start": 835, "char_end": 856}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "所谓利诱，是指“你要是肯爱我，我就如何如何”。", "char_start": 857, "char_end": 880}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "不要故意引人丧失理智或者剥夺人的自由即可。", "char_start": 881, "char_end": 902}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "展现优点、表达爱意、作出贡献，这些不属于“威逼利诱”的范畴。", "char_start": 903, "char_end": 933}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：怎么让一个女人深深的爱上你？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021"], "summary": "围绕“让爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你的确有可能做到让别人深深的迷恋你、深深的依赖你、深深的向往你、深深的渴望你、深深的崇拜你、深深的相信你、深深的感激你……但你做不到“让”人深深的爱你。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你的确有可能做到让别人深深的迷恋你、深深的依赖你、深深的向往你、深深的渴望你、深深的崇拜你、深深的相信你、深深的感激你……但你做不到“让”人深深的爱你。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "54f77345-b204-55e4-a6b8-82ae20ad01e9", "source_ordinal": 2324, "reading_ordinal": 1731, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "杀人诛心", "published_at": "2023-04-01T02:47:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/378231496/answer/2963036232"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "就是不但要杀你，还要想出个办法解释为是因为你很邪恶所以杀得对、杀得好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "而且只要是你的死亡定格成这样一个状态，那么很自然你的死亡就成了真正的结束，将不会有人翻案、不会有人替你鸣冤、也不会有人替你报复。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 100}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "之所以一些人要追求这种诛杀方式，就是为了获得这种干净而无后患的解决。", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 135}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你可能觉得这非常可怕和残酷，但在古代，这反而往往还是一种“仁慈”。", "char_start": 136, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "因为给当事人定一个“阴谋不轨、蛊惑人心”的罪名，就等于把亲族朋友下属都撇清了，只需要这些人声明不知情、再一起“痛斥”一下，就可以避免被牵连。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这样，上位者也可以基本放心，这是一个没有后患的结局了。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 268}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果不搞或者搞不成这种诛心，那么替代方案就只剩下满门抄斩，夷平九族，把可能不满和报仇的干系人全部杀光，才能达到同样的无后患结局。", "char_start": 269, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这才是“杀人诛心”变成古代朝野斗争的常见甚至普遍现象的内在原因。", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 366}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这背后是那九五至尊、孤家寡人的无法平息的安全焦虑。", "char_start": 367, "char_end": 392}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这也是诛心的底层原因——它本质上就是一种安全感焦虑，动不动就想“绝对安全”。", "char_start": 393, "char_end": 431}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "所以越脆弱的人越喜欢诛心，这不是什么好现象。", "char_start": 432, "char_end": 454}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：什么叫“杀人诛心”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“杀人诛心”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“就是不但要杀你，还要想出个办法解释为是因为你很邪恶所以杀得对、杀得好。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "就是不但要杀你，还要想出个办法解释为是因为你很邪恶所以杀得对、杀得好。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "50d69dcd-6c6a-5153-93dc-7c85fbfff740", "source_ordinal": 2323, "reading_ordinal": 1732, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "待成熟", "published_at": "2023-04-01T13:37:42+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/581967188/answer/2963525760"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "对方觉得你不成熟，说不会等你，希望能有各自的生活。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你如果说“好的，也祝你一切顺利。一切随缘”，那么你就比她想象的成熟，至少离她想要的成熟比她原本想象的近。", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你如果说“我哪里不成熟”、“不成熟也可以当朋友啊”、“当我成熟一些再来找你”……之类的“不接受”的话，那么你就果然如她所料的不成熟，而且至少暂时还没有向那个方向靠拢的意识和迹象。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "heading", "index": 4, "text": "“做事总能超脱一切干扰基于对现状的尊重和接受去争取最大可能的未来”，就是绝大多数人所在意的那个神秘的“成熟”。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 224}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "注意，这种成熟本身没有道德性，不是说有这种成熟的人就一定是个好人——没准ta追求的是毁灭地球的最大可能也说不定。", "char_start": 225, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "但是这意味着这样的人往往因为总是大概率能实现目的而有比较可靠有效的计划和理想，有更强的创造价值、获得成果的能力。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 338}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "于是自然也就有与合作者、共生者分享价值的基本条件。", "char_start": 339, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "也就是有可能成为一个净输出者。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只有潜在的净输出者，才有可能值得下注。", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 400}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 8, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果喜欢一个女生不小心被知道了，但她说自己不够成熟，可以当好朋友还有机会吗?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009"], "summary": "围绕“待成熟”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“对方觉得你不成熟，说不会等你，希望能有各自的生活。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "对方觉得你不成熟，说不会等你，希望能有各自的生活。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 25, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "b52a2af5-3c4d-5f9a-9e73-00ace9a3dee3", "source_ordinal": 2322, "reading_ordinal": 1733, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "36度5", "published_at": "2023-04-02T13:59:55+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/585441313/answer/2964847711"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "除非我们的计算方式发生某种革命性的进步，否则要完成这个转变恐怕非常的困难。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "有一点问题，现在其实已经很严重，将来可能更加严重到碰壁，那就是ai服务的成本。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你们要意识到人脑的计算量所导致的发热只不过让你的额头温度达到36.5摄氏度，", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你每天就靠三顿饭供能，要是不运动，单靠高强度的思考消耗能量，你还会成为一个可悲的胖子。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 160}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "而以大语言模型现在的“千亿参数模式”，恐怕和人类真正的思考方式有着原理性的差异。", "char_start": 161, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这就像飞艇和固定翼飞机的差异一样，看似飞艇也飞上去了，甚至升限还吓死人的高，但是如果要给它装上一台足够提升机动性到战斗机水平的发动机，却是千难万难，甚至在工程上不现实。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 286}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "现有的靠硅基通用逻辑芯片来进行“力大砖飞式”的智能模拟，很可能是条死路。", "char_start": 287, "char_end": 323}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "因为人脑真正的优越性恐怕不在于它的逻辑运算能力，而在于它是对特定运算特化过的硬件结构。", "char_start": 324, "char_end": 367}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "很多根本的基础概念——例如公平、正义、爱、美、模式识别等关键处理能力，恐怕不是以软件形式安装在一个通用运算单元里，而是如同显卡专门设计来处理三角形填充那样，有各自专属的硬件构造，所以才能有这样卓越的效率，才能是36.5摄氏度。", "char_start": 368, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "而这个特化的硬件构造恐怕不是现在的技术路线所能企及。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "为什么呢？因为本质上这个硬件方案唯有生存竞争机制有能力调优。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 539}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "设想一下，即使我“Chat张三”训练到了一定程度，对于正义、爱的运算有了足够的洞见，以至于可以为它的运行设计特别优化的硬件。", "char_start": 540, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "我也挡不住“Chat李四”对这些关键问题有另一种能自圆其说的洞见。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 636}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "我们谁也没有资格说洒家就是终极真理，只能是两个方案自由竞争，幸存到最后的胜出。然后在胜者的身上再分叉处不同版本的新洞见、新特化硬件，再竞争。", "char_start": 637, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这才是人类走到今天的实际历程。", "char_start": 708, "char_end": 723}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人脑的基本构造的极大相似性意味着我们的一些底层的共识已经硬性的构造在生理结构中了，这个生理结构——而不是这个结构中后天沉淀的可以用语言、图像描述的“明文”部分——才是人类思维的真正奥妙所在。", "char_start": 724, "char_end": 819}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "如果有一种说法表面上能自圆其说但却与我们的硬件结构不兼容，它就处在一个“勉强能运行”的“硬拗”状态。", "char_start": 820, "char_end": 870}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "形式逻辑上没法说错，但是你就是拳头发紧，想打ta。", "char_start": 871, "char_end": 896}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "没有这个先天的特化结构不停的对这些装不下去的糊涂精神过敏，思维将会在无限种对等的自洽稳态中迷失。", "char_start": 897, "char_end": 945}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "大公无私也可以，无毒不丈夫也行，逼得急了，它就双管齐下——“一方面，啊，那啥，另一方面，啊，啊，那啥啥”。", "char_start": 946, "char_end": 999}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "这幅欠揍的衰样，正好完美通过图灵测试。", "char_start": 1000, "char_end": 1019}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "Which is another poetic irony.", "char_start": 1020, "char_end": 1050}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "不解决这个硬件优化问题，ChatGPT5一动感情，它的机房头顶上的冰川就要冒汗。", "char_start": 1051, "char_end": 1091}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "听段相声，北极熊灭绝了。", "char_start": 1092, "char_end": 1104}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 24}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：人工智能将来如果拥有了意识，也会拥有好奇心、想象力、创造力、情商、随机应变的柔性思维吗？为什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024"], "summary": "围绕“36度5”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“除非我们的计算方式发生某种革命性的进步，否则要完成这个转变恐怕非常的困难。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "除非我们的计算方式发生某种革命性的进步，否则要完成这个转变恐怕非常的困难。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "c6f1ef42-7343-5f7e-a883-974c3859b096", "source_ordinal": 2321, "reading_ordinal": 1734, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "精致罪", "published_at": "2023-04-02T21:15:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/538350185/answer/2965354372"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这样的人很可怜的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "因为按照这个标准，怕是能幸免于ta的批判的乐事寥寥无几——如果不是根本没有的话。", "char_start": 10, "char_end": 50}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你要找道理去说什么什么事情很恶心、很虚伪、很blar blar blar，你只要找到“有这么一部分人有问题”这一步，哪有找不到的？", "char_start": 51, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "当和尚都有花和尚好吗。", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 128}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "苛刻到这一步，世界上还能剩下啥？", "char_start": 129, "char_end": 145}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你要怎么快乐得起来？", "char_start": 146, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "另一个令人哑然无语的奇怪概念就是所谓的“伪精致”。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这有两种讲法：", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 191}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "一种是“精致我还是赞许的，只不过你们这是假精致，我是真精致”。那么就不知尊驾的真精致是何等境界，可否见告一二？", "char_start": 192, "char_end": 247}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你怕不怕你拿出来的“真精致”被人骂到自闭？", "char_start": 248, "char_end": 269}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "有无数人在等着骂还你，你心里很清楚，只要用上你同样的标准和“批判手法”，你其实也会体无完肤，不是吗？", "char_start": 270, "char_end": 320}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "另一种是干脆否定“精致”这个概念本身。", "char_start": 321, "char_end": 340}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "那么，“美国红脖子”应该算是世界上最糙、离精致最远的一群道德典范了吧？", "char_start": 341, "char_end": 376}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你把他的枪往地上摔一下、踹他哈雷戴维森一脚试试？信不信立刻让你知道什么叫铁汉柔情？", "char_start": 377, "char_end": 418}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "人家弹夹都是自配的，每颗子弹都是亲手组装的，精致得像心肝宝贝一样。", "char_start": 419, "char_end": 452}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "人类只不过是精致的猿，“精致”就是文明的指南针。完全否定精致、讲究的价值，岂不是要爬回树上吃无花果？", "char_start": 453, "char_end": 503}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 17}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待说露营是伪精致？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“精致罪”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这样的人很可怜的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这样的人很可怜的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 9, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "45acf0c3-2670-5918-9d27-ee5a47410d91", "source_ordinal": 2320, "reading_ordinal": 1735, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "说废话的朋友", "published_at": "2023-04-03T01:59:11+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/592523167/answer/2965645980"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "时间就是生命，那是不可能拿来说废话的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我说的不一定对、不一定全、你不一定能用上，但是我一直严守价值原则，不会讲我自己就觉得对你没可能有什么用的话——一定是出于看到了对你存在某种有用的可能、某种可能的意义，我才能相信“引你花时间注意这些话、理解这些话不是一种故意的罪行”。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "我觉得这是一种对待朋友、甚至对待陌生人的很基本的义务，否则不断的想办法引人注意、诱人跟自己说话，只是纯粹为了解决自己的寂寞或恐惧，或者存粹为了满足自己的什么诉求，完全不考虑这些对对方有什么价值和收益，这与劫掠何异？", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "“说废话”和“朋友”在我看来是逻辑不兼容的，对人说废话，本身就是不把对方当作朋友看待的证明了。", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 292}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "也就是说，逻辑上你根本没法“有说废话的朋友”。", "char_start": 293, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一般人做这种主张，是因为ta的废话标准并不是“毫无意义”，而是提高到了比如“没有直接经济利益”这样的层面，于是把一些具有非物质价值的话算成了废话。这其实并不与上面的原则相抵触。", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 405}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果你真的坚持要以“能忍受毫无意义的废话”作为“真友谊的证明”，那么你其实是在主张一种合法的掠夺权，和主张“真朋友就能给我占便宜”一样，在现实中恐怕很难行通。", "char_start": 406, "char_end": 485}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有人说「老朋友是用来说废话的」，你认同吗，有这样的「废话挚友」吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“说废话的朋友”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“时间就是生命，那是不可能拿来说废话的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "时间就是生命，那是不可能拿来说废话的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "3a71ddf7-b0ea-58f6-8c08-a3881e2a65ac", "source_ordinal": 2319, "reading_ordinal": 1736, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "兼得", "published_at": "2023-04-04T16:19:03+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/593491432/answer/2968189284"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "刘看山犯了一个错误，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "就是认为“留下数字遗产”和“被网络遗忘”不可兼得。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "小孩子才做选择。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 45}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-04/04/8f3ecac6cd340b64c426795156aef58a.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 4, "image": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：当你去世时，是想被网络遗忘还是留下你的「数字遗产」？你会如何处理自己的数字遗产？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003"], "summary": "围绕“兼得”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“刘看山犯了一个错误，”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "刘看山犯了一个错误，", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7bd373f4-2926-5d97-997e-c58bc09f60be", "source_ordinal": 2318, "reading_ordinal": 1737, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "防核战", "published_at": "2023-04-05T01:08:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/455234263/answer/2968873649"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "当然是迅速前往附近的人防工事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这主要是指地铁站、地下车库、专门的避难所等公共设施。中国在这方面已经下了不少功夫，加上现代建筑业的长足发展和钢筋混凝土结构的普遍应用，其实核弹对有预警时间的人群的直接杀伤已经大不如二战期间。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "如果是凌空爆炸——这非常可能——基本上只有爆点附近几百米的建筑会彻底结构性破坏，再稍微远一点主要是会被巨大的气浪冲击波剥去一切附着物，比如隔墙和幕墙玻璃，被吹得只剩下混凝土骨架。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 201}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "再远点因为冲击波在密集的建筑群的遮挡吸收能力的中和下已经极大的被削弱，受的损失就更加大大缩小了。", "char_start": 202, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你及时躲入地下，那么安然无恙的概率很高。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 273}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "所以完全没有必要觉得“逃生没有意义”。", "char_start": 274, "char_end": 293}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "准备好应急装备会大有好处。", "char_start": 294, "char_end": 307}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 7}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0263"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如果得知一枚核弹将在10分钟后在你的城市爆炸，除了等死还能干嘛？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007"], "summary": "围绕“防核战”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“当然是迅速前往附近的人防工事。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "当然是迅速前往附近的人防工事。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
